{"id":"e85b3308cfc79da5","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-finite-field-projective-variety.md","title":"Smooth Projective Variety over a Finite Field","display":"df-finite-field-projective-variety — Smooth Projective Variety over a Finite Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-finite-field-projective-variety","aliases":["58-df-finite-field-projective-variety"],"display":"df-finite-field-projective-variety — Smooth Projective Variety over a Finite Field","depends_on":["[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-algebra2-ideal-generated]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-finite-field-projective-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-finite-field-projective-variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-field-projective-variety — Smooth Projective Variety over a Finite Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c67a99fda9158bac\" href=\"?note=c67a99fda9158bac\" title=\"58-df-zfc-algebra2-ideal-generated\">58-df-zfc-algebra2-ideal-generated</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> is a field, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\omega\">\\(q\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is a finitely generated homogeneous ideal of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n]\">\\(k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:m\\to I\">\\(f:m\\to I\\)</span> is a displayed finite homogeneous generating family and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\langle k,n,I,f\\rangle\">\\(X=\\langle k,n,I,f\\rangle\\)</span> is the corresponding projective presentation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_f(x)\">\\(J_f(x)\\)</span> is the Jacobian matrix of that displayed generating family at a geometric point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2IdealGenerated}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2IdealGenerated}_S\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(K)\">\\(X(K)\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S(k,q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k)\\land q\\in\\omega\\land |k|=q&lt;\\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S(k,q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k)\\land q\\in\\omega\\land |k|=q&lt;\\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}variety\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X=\\langle k,n,I,f\\rangle\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(f,m,k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n])\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2IdealGenerated}_S\\!\\left(I,\\operatorname{ran}(f),k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n],+_{k[x]},\\cdot_{k[x]},0_{k[x]},1_{k[x]}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j\\in m\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in k^{n+1}\\;(f(j)(ax)=a^d f(j)(x))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}variety\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X=\\langle k,n,I,f\\rangle\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(f,m,k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n])\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2IdealGenerated}_S\\!\\left(I,\\operatorname{ran}(f),k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n],+_{k[x]},\\cdot_{k[x]},0_{k[x]},1_{k[x]}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j\\in m\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in k^{n+1}\\;(f(j)(ax)=a^d f(j)(x))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field\\text{-}projective\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\land k\\subseteq K\\to\nX(K)\\coloneqq\\{[x]\\in\\mathbb P^n(K):\\forall f\\in I\\;(f(x)=0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field\\text{-}projective\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\land k\\subseteq K\\to\nX(K)\\coloneqq\\{[x]\\in\\mathbb P^n(K):\\forall f\\in I\\;(f(x)=0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}projective\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,k,q,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S(k,q)\\land\\exists n,I,f\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land d\\in\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in X(\\overline k)\\;\\operatorname{rank}J_f(x)=n-d\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}projective\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,k,q,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S(k,q)\\land\\exists n,I,f\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land d\\in\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in X(\\overline k)\\;\\operatorname{rank}J_f(x)=n-d\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A projective variety is represented by an explicit finite homogeneous generating map. The ring ideal is defined by the exact generated-ideal predicate, not by tuple ellipsis or the unrelated set-ideal predicate.</li>\n<li>Including the generating map in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> makes the Jacobian matrix determinate; different presentations may describe isomorphic varieties, but no hidden generator choice affects this predicate.</li>\n<li>The Jacobian-rank clause gives geometric smoothness after base change to the algebraic closure.</li>\n<li>This presentation is sufficient for the local zeta series and the smooth-projective form of Deligne purity used downstream.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-ideal-generated","status":"resolved","id":"c67a99fda9158bac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-algebra2-ideal-generated]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n]","display":false},{"tex":"f:m\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\langle k,n,I,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"J_f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2IdealGenerated}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S","display":false},{"tex":"X(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S(k,q)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k)\\land q\\in\\omega\\land |k|=q<\\omega","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}variety\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land X=\\langle k,n,I,f\\rangle\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Function}(f,m,k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n])\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2IdealGenerated}_S\\!\\left(I,\\operatorname{ran}(f),k[x_0,\\ldots,x_n],+_{k[x]},\\cdot_{k[x]},0_{k[x]},1_{k[x]}\\right)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall j\\in m\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\\forall x\\in k^{n+1}\\;(f(j)(ax)=a^d f(j)(x))\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field\\text{-}projective\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\land k\\subseteq K\\to\nX(K)\\coloneqq\\{[x]\\in\\mathbb P^n(K):\\forall f\\in I\\;(f(x)=0)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}projective\\text{-}finite\\text{-}field\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,k,q,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S(k,q)\\land\\exists n,I,f\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveVarietyPresentation}_S(X,k,n,I,f)\\\\\n&{}\\land d\\in\\omega\\land\\forall x\\in X(\\overline k)\\;\\operatorname{rank}J_f(x)=n-d\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":3066,"backlinks":[{"id":"adeb1236931d5593","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a870504ed2ae0cf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S$ and $\\mathrm{FiniteField}_S$ are supplied by [[58-df-finite-field-projective-variety]]."},{"id":"e6a4271733f0e0d4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveVarietyOver}_S(X,\\mathbb F_q,q,d)$ (see [[58-df-finite-field-projective-variety]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-field-projective-variety]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-525","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-finite-field-projective-variety.md|58-df-finite-field-projective-variety]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751","c67a99fda9158bac"]}